+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added a new `CSVDocumentSplitter` component to `haystack.components.preprocessors`.
+    It splits CSV documents into sub-tables by detecting consecutive empty rows and/or
+    columns that exceed a configurable threshold, avoiding the need for a custom
+    `splitting_function` passed to `DocumentSplitter`.
